[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-charles-darwin-university-rtp-scholarship-2027-fully-funded-opportunity-277":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},277,"charles-darwin-university-rtp-scholarship-2027-fully-funded-opportunity-277","Charles Darwin University Rtp Scholarship 2027: Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Charles Darwin University RTP Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Charles Darwin University \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-australia\u002F\">Study-In-Australia\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Australia\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fphd-scholarships\u002F\">PhD Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>$35,489 \u003C\u002Fstrong>Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>$2,500 Relocation Allowance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: Not Specified\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Charles Darwin University RTP Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Australian Government supports international students with full funding via the Charles Darwin University RTP Scholarship to study in Australia.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Charles Darwin University RTP Scholarship offers prospective Master’s and PhD students the opportunity to take their research potentials to the next level in a top Australian university.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>All Scholarships are considered and awarded through a competitive process. Interested applicants should read this post in full for a breakdown of the application procedure.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Charles Darwin University RTP Scholarship 2027 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Australian Government RTP Stipend Scholarships are awarded to students of exceptional research potential to undertake an HDR at an Australian university.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The scholarships are provided to assist with general living costs for three years full-time for a doctoral degree and two years for a research Master’s degree.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>AU$35,489 (2026 rate)\u003C\u002Fstrong> per annum tax-free for \u003Cstrong>full-time students\u003C\u002Fstrong>, paid in fortnightly instalments.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>17,744.50 (2026 rate)\u003C\u002Fstrong> per annum, \u003Cem>taxable\u003C\u002Fem>, for \u003Cstrong>part-time student\u003C\u002Fstrong>s, paid in fortnightly instalment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Additional benefits include:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>paid sick leave\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>maternity leave\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>relocation allowance. The relocation allowance for RTP stipend recipients is up to $2,000 for domestic students and $2,500 for international students. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Charles Darwin University RTP Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the postgraduate Charles Darwin University RTP Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>must be enrolled in an accredited HDR course of study at an Australian Higher \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcharles-darwin-university-rtp-scholarship\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>Education\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> Provider (HEP)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>demonstrate exceptional research potential to undertake an HDR.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>must not receive income from another source to support your general living costs while enrolled in a course of study if that income is greater than 75% of the RTP stipend rate.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Charles Darwin University RTP Scholarship 2027\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Charles Darwin University RTP Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the details we have provided on this page for full information on how to apply\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the button below to visit the scholarship application website\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply for a Master’s by Research or a Doctoral degree at CDU\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply for the scholarship using the APPLY button on the scholarship information page\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Only complete applications will be assessed.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Begin your application by clicking on the button below.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Deadline: Not Specified\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.cdu.edu.au\u002Fresearch-and-innovation\u002Fhigher-degree-research\u002Fscholarships\u002Fcompetitive-round-scholarship?utm_source=Scholars+World\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.cdu.edu.au\u002Fresearch-and-innovation\u002Fhigher-degree-research\u002Fscholarships\u002Fcompetitive-round-scholarship?utm_source=Scholars+World\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-06-02 17:41:20",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fcharles-darwin-university-rtp-scholarship-2027-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a1f07b036f6c6.22572287_screenshot 2026-06-02 171022.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fcharles-darwin-university-rtp-scholarship-2027-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a1f07b036f6c6.22572287_screenshot%202026-06-02%20171022.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u0